$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Preparation of
(1α,3aβ,9bβ)-6-hydroxy-1-isopropyl-3a,8-dimethyl-3,3a-dihydro-1Hcyclopenta[
a]naphthalene-4,5(2H,9bH)-dione (18): Phenol 3 (150 mg, 0.55 mmol) was
dissolved in 2 mL of dioxane and SeO2 (183 mg, 1.65 mmol, 3 equiv.) was
added neat. The reaction was refluxed for 16 h with 10 drops of H2O added
slowly over the first hour, and then cooled to room temperature and
concentrated in vacuo. The crude mixture was purified via flash
chromatography (50:1 petroleum ether:ethyl acetate) to give an orange
solid (92% yield). Mp 91-93 °; IR (KBr) 3000 (br, OH), 1724 (C=O), 1635
(C=O) cm-1; 1H-NMR (CDCl3) δ 11.9 (s, 1H), 6.71 (s, 1H), 6.67 (s, 1H),
3.38 (d, J=9.2 Hz, 1H), 2.60 (ddd, J=7.5, 5.5, 2.0 Hz, 1H), 2.36 (s, 3H),
(ddd, J=13.6, 7.5, 6.1 Hz, 1H), 1.50-1.85 (m, 3H), 1.26 (s, 3H),
1.09-1.25 (septet, J=6.6 Hz, 1H), 0.52 (d, J=6.6 Hz, 3H), 0.40 (d, J=6.6
Hz, 3H) ppm; 13CNMR (CDCl3) δ 200.1, 184.4, 164.7, 150.8, 144.2, 123.4,
116.7, 116.2, 56.9, 56.5, 51.4, 33.8, 29.1, 26.9, 24.4, 23.2, 22.5, 19.8
ppm; mass spectrum, m/z (%, relative intensity) 286 (M+, 20), 258 (M+-CO,
75), 176 (100) amu. Exact mass for C18H22O3 (M+): calcd 286.1569, found
286.1567 amu.
