$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (-)-Methyl ent-15,16-Beyerandion-19-oate (3) A suspension of
(-)-isosteviol methyl ester (10.1 g, 30 mmol) and selenium dioxide (4.4
g, 54 mmol) in xylene (150 mL) was stirred under reflux for 48 h. The
inorganic solid was filtered off with the aid of CeliteTM. The filter
cake was extensively rinsed with CH2Cl2 and the filtrate was concentrated
in vacuum. The crude product was purified by column chromatography
(cyclohexane-EtOAc, 95:5). Orange crystalline solid, yield 9.0 g (85%).
M.p 190 °C; [α]D25 -173.9 (c 1.00, CHCl3). 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3): δ =
0.53 (s, 3 H, CH3), 0.86 (dt, J = 13.1, 4.1 Hz, 1 H), 0.99 (dd, J = 13.5,
4.1 Hz, 1 H), 1.11 (s, 3 H, CH3), 1.14 (dd, J = 12.7, 2.0 Hz, 1 H), 1.19
(s, 3 H, CH3), 1.18-1.31 (m, 2 H), 1.37-1.44 (m, 1 H), 1.53-1.64 (m, 3
H), 1.71-1.85 (m, 4 H), 1.87-1.94 (m, 2 H), 1.96-2.01 (m, 1 H), 2.14-2.19
(m, 1 H), 2.24-2.35 (m, 1 H), 3.64 (s, 3 H, OCH3). 13C NMR (100 MHz,
CDCl3): δ = 11.4, 18.9, 20.1, 20.8, 21.4, 28.7, 34.1, 37.9, 38.7, 39.7,
39.8, 43.7, 46.9, 47.3, 50.5, 51.3, 56.2, 59.6, 177.6, 208.8, 210.1. MS
(EI, 70 eV): m/z (%) = 346.2 (25) [M]+, 318.2 (6), 290.2 (100), 276.2
(18), 231.2 (55), 180.1 (37). Anal. Calcd for C21H30O4: C, 72.80; H,
8.73. Found: C, 72.51; H, 8.85.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Riley oxidation
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Synthesis and reactivity of (+)-16-deoxo-15-oxoisosteviol
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Bomkamp, Martin; Gottfried, Katharina; Kataeva, Olga; Waldvogel,
Siegfried R.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Synthesis (2008), (9), 1443-1447

